# Brand logo

## Official mark (第一张图)

- File: `public/brand/logo-icon.png`
- Content: **circular dog + cat emblem only** (leaves + pink heart). **No text baked into the image.**
- This is the site LOGO graphic for header, footer, favicon/`src/app/icon.png`.

## Wordmark text (第二张图的文字)

Place beside the mark in the header lockup (`BrandLogo` `variant="full"`), left → right:

1. Circular mark (`logo-icon.png`)
2. Text block on the **right**:
   - **Pet Memo Shop** (serif)
   - divider with small paw
   - **FOREVER IN OUR HEARTS**
   - **Memories Never Fade, Love Never Ends** (can hide on very small screens)

Do **not** stack wordmark text under the circular mark in the header (that caused cropped text bugs).

## Rules

- Do not replace the mark with `logo-full.png` (that asset includes stacked text under the icon).
- Do not change header nav order when adjusting the logo: Home → Shop → Digital Memorial → Best Sellers → Blog → About Us → Contact, same row as the logo.
- Keep logo + nav on one row on desktop.
